{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act Casual is an 8 player party brawler where a very disciplined crew of crash-landed aliens waits patiently on Earth for rescue. Blending in flawlessly with humanity, none of them ever get bored and start brawling; since getting caught for failing their human tasks could mean serious trouble! It would be totally reckless to try and juggle fighting AND human tasks in an unpredictable world all at once. Although that could be fun...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you adjust to this planet's gravity, fling your self around, be resourceful, and find unique ways to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight locally or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content rich game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character from our lovable extraterrestial cast</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2979530?t=1771518637","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2979530?t=1771518637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771518637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771518637","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Famil